WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.523
I am Hope.

00:00:01.523 --> 00:00:04.796
Long ago, I swam the ocean as a blue

00:00:04.796 --> 00:00:05.415
whale.

00:00:05.415 --> 00:00:08.512
On the morning of 25 March 1891, I

00:00:08.512 --> 00:00:11.873
stranded on a sandbar at the mouth of

00:00:11.873 --> 00:00:14.600
Wexford Harbour, in Ireland.

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:18.157
My skeleton was sold to the museum for

00:00:18.157 --> 00:00:19.082
250 pounds.

00:00:19.082 --> 00:00:21.857
In July 2017 I was unveiled here in

00:00:21.857 --> 00:00:22.859
Hintze Hall.

00:00:22.859 --> 00:00:25.327
They named me Hope: a symbol of

00:00:25.327 --> 00:00:28.410
humanity's power to shape a sustainable

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:29.200
future.
